GET {{baseUrl}}/repeated-headers

::: post
test("repeated headers are visible", () => {
  expect(res.headers.get("x-repeated")).toContain("one");
  expect(res.headers.get("set-cookie")).toContain("a=1");
  expect(res.headers.get("x-mixed-case")).toBe("Value With Spaces");
});

::: docs
The server sends X-Repeated three times and Set-Cookie twice.
